Summary:
1. Primary Request and Intent:
   The user's Santhicaios iOS app (a medical prescription management app for Indian doctors) has been through multiple rounds of code audit and fixes. The explicit requests in this session were:
   - Complete the 7 remaining fixes from the previous audit session
   - Answer questions about where data is stored and whether frontend code is updated
   - Push all changes to GitHub repo (https://github.com/rylinjames/santhicaios-.git)
