   - Fix ALL 34 identified issues (the most recent and currently active request)

2. Key Technical Concepts:
   - SwiftUI + SwiftData (iOS persistence framework, stores Patient, Visit, Prescription models)
   - MVVM architecture with Repository pattern
   - `@Observable` macro for reactive state management
   - `@MainActor` for thread safety with UI updates
   - iOS Keychain for secure credential storage
   - XOR obfuscation for API key bundling (migrated to Keychain)
   - OpenAI GPT-5 mini API for prescription OCR
   - AVFoundation for camera capture
   - PHPickerViewController for gallery image selection
   - CSV export with share sheet integration
   - `PBXFileSystemSynchronizedRootGroup` (Xcode auto-discovers files, no manual project file updates needed)
   - Biometric authentication (Face ID / passcode)
   - PII filtering in logging
   - File protection attributes for database encryption at rest

